        "title": "Lets Encrypt SSL API Errors",
        "body": "We have identified an issue on free cert issuance and renewals for custom CDN domains. We have observed a delay from Lets Encrypt API endpoint causing these delays. Existing certificates on custom domains will continue to function as normal - however new and cert renewals via our free certificate option may experience a delay to the certificate issuance.",
