      "recent_incidents": [
        {
          "title": "Investigating Issues with Magic Containers and Databases",
          "body": "Processing Delays and Intermittent Timeouts for Magic Containers\n\nOn June 1, Magic Containers experienced degraded service for approximately one hour due to a network connectivity issue in our hosting provider's environment. Customers running workloads may have seen increased processing delays, intermittent timeouts, temporary disruption, or reduced availability as some workloads were automatically rescheduled. The issue was resolved after the underlying network conditions stabilized, allowing scheduling activity to resume normally.\n\nWe are improving the resilience of Magic Containers so degraded connectivity can be detected and handled more effectively, not only complete outages. We are also adding safeguards to reduce unnecessary or duplicate workload rescheduling during degraded conditions, helping limit customer impact if similar infrastructure issues occur again.",
          "date": "2026-06-03T09:17:01.466Z",
          "link": "https://stspg.io/71ppnx6tdv08",
          "status": "postmortem",
          "impact": "major"
